{"slug":"pronouns-starter-l9","artistFeel":"Nirvana","beat":"Romantic Slow","data":{"title":"Pronouns — Starter · Lesson 9","subject":"pronouns","subjectLabel":"Pronouns","level":"starter","lesson":9,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"90s","lyrics":"[Intro]\n¡Dale! Let's explore.\n\n[Hook]\nI see… Veo\nThis city… esta ciudad\nMe and you… tú y yo\nFeeling free… sintiéndonos libres\nVamos, let's go.\n\n[Verse]\nStreets alive, lights so bright,\nlearning fast as we walk tonight.\nThis… este\nBuilding here… este edificio aquí\nThat… ese\nOne over there… ese de allí\nIt's the same… es lo mismo\nDay or night… de día o noche\nAnother turn… otro giro\nTo find new sights… para ver más.\n\n[Hook]\nI see… Veo\nThis city… esta ciudad\nMe and you… tú y yo\nFeeling free… sintiéndonos libres\nVamos, let's go.\n\n[Verse]\nPeople passing, someone… alguien\nWaving hi… saludando aquí\nNo one… nadie\nFeels alone… se siente solo\nWhen we're all… cuando todos\nIn the same… en el mismo\nPlace, much love… lugar, mucho amor\nLittle by little… poco a poco\nWe find our way… encontramos el camino.\n\n[Bridge]\nExploring… explorando\nEvery corner… cada esquina\nWith you… contigo\nIt's magic… es mágico\nNo rush… sin prisa\nJust us… solo nosotros\nIn this moment… en este momento","vocab":[{"es":"este","en":"this"},{"es":"ese","en":"that"},{"es":"aquí","en":"here"},{"es":"allí","en":"there"},{"es":"mismo","en":"same"},{"es":"otro","en":"other"},{"es":"mucho","en":"much"},{"es":"poco","en":"little"},{"es":"alguien","en":"someone"},{"es":"nadie","en":"no one"},{"es":"algo","en":"something"},{"es":"nada","en":"nothing"},{"es":"cada","en":"each"},{"es":"ambos","en":"both"},{"es":"varios","en":"several"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.08,"end":1.331,"loss":4.232566545123146},{"start":5.26,"end":9.381,"loss":4.053350630260649},{"start":11.4,"end":17.68,"loss":2.5116327073838978},{"start":17.68,"end":20.7,"loss":2.6746890178093543},{"start":20.76,"end":26.64,"loss":3.068446124546112},{"start":26.64,"end":28.361,"loss":